        "TileImage": "$($repository 87be73e8-64a2-4381-8438-013bb5d4f241).Image",
        "Description": "A private security squad funded by The Harmonium has taken over an Ether Labs satellite. We believe they are using it to encrypt their communications systems to a level that would make them borderline unstoppable. \r\rYou have been contracted to eliminate the four leaders of the squad; without them, it should be no problem for us to capture the satellite for our own purposes.\r\rThey believe the island is remote enough for them to hide. Prove them wrong.\r\rEliminate the targets.",
